OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fcloudy night, with spells of drizzle
OL,7,Fbecoming more persistent particularly
OL,8,Fover the high ground in the north.
OL,9,FWinds will ease to a light breeze by
OL,10,Fdawn. Feeling chilly in the north.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FTuesday will be cloudy, with
OL,13,Fa mild start for most but cooler for
OL,14,FCumbria. Drizzle to start, and
OL,15,Falthough drying up during the day,
OL,16,Frain will return in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
