OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FWednesday and Thursday will be bright
OL,7,Fwith sunny spells and a cool, autumnal
OL,8,Fbreeze. Showers most likely over high
OL,9,Fground on Wednesday. A return to
OL,10,Funsettled weather from Thursday night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
